@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="card shadow-sm mt-4 mb-4">
    <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
        <h1 class="mb-0"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill me-2"></i>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="card-body p-4">
        <p class="lead">At WorkNestify, we are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring the security of your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your data when you use our job search and recruitment platform.</p>
        
        <hr />

        <h2 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="bi bi-info-circle me-2"></i>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect various types of information to provide and improve our services:</p>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
            <li class="list-group-item"><i class="bi bi-person-fill me-2"></i><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, and other details you provide when creating an account or applying for jobs.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text me-2"></i><strong>Job Application Data:</strong> Resumes, cover letters, and other documents you upload.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><i class="bi bi-briefcase me-2"></i><strong>Employer Data:</strong> Company details, job postings, and application management information.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><i class="bi bi-activity me-2"></i><strong>Usage Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, pages visited, and interactions with our platform.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="bi bi-question-circle me-2"></i>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Your information is used to:</p>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
            <li class="list-group-item">Facilitate job applications and employer recruitment processes.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Improve our platform’s functionality and user experience.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Communicate with you about job opportunities, account updates, or support.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Ensure compliance with legal obligations and protect against fraud.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="bi bi-share me-2"></i>3. Information Sharing</h2>
        <p>We may share your information with:</p>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Employers:</strong> When you apply for a job, your application details are shared with the relevant employer.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Third-party vendors who assist with hosting, analytics, or payment processing.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Legal Authorities:</strong> If required by law or to protect our rights and users.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

        <h2 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="bi bi-shield-check me-2"></i>4. Data Security</h2>
        <p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data, including encryption and secure servers. However, no system is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute protection against unauthorized access.</p>

        <h2 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="bi bi-person-lines-fill me-2"></i>5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
            <li class="list-group-item">Access, update, or delete your personal information.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Opt-out of marketing communications.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Request data portability where applicable.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@worknestify.com" class="text-primary">support@worknestify.com</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="bi bi-clock-history me-2"></i>6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain your information for as long as necessary to provide our services or comply with legal requirements. Inactive accounts may be deleted after a specified period.</p>

        <h2 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="bi bi-cookie me-2"></i>7. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p>We use cookies to enhance your experience, analyze usage, and deliver personalized content. You can manage cookie preferences through your browser settings.</p>

        <h2 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="bi bi-globe me-2"></i>8. International Transfers</h2>
        <p>Your data may be transferred to and processed in countries outside your jurisdiction, subject to appropriate safeguards.</p>

        <h2 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat me-2"></i>9. Updates to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.</p>

        <h2 class="fw-bold mt-4"><i class="bi bi-telephone me-2"></i>10. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have questions or concerns about this policy, please reach out to us:</p>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-3">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@worknestify.com" class="text-primary">support@worknestify.com</a></li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Address:</strong> WorkNestify, FPT University, Thach Hoa, Thach That, Ha Noi</li>
        </ul>

        <hr />

        <p class="text-muted small">Effective Date: March 24, 2025</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Action Button -->
    <div class="card-footer bg-light">
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end">
            <a asp-area="JobSeeker" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index"
               class="btn btn-outline-secondary px-4">
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-2"></i>Back to Home
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>